  "body": "## What\n\nVersion bump to 5.7.0 covering the merged unit since 5.6.0 (#108):\n\n- **Dedicated Claude Code page** — the settings config moves off the Providers page onto its own \"Claude Code\" nav view, with a page heading explaining the one-click Configure flow. Onboarding and the Guide route to the new page.\n- **Theme picker consistency** — the selected pill no longer recolors per theme accent (full emerald/red fill); it uses a neutral raised surface with an accent ring, identical across all four themes.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Full suite: 3706 passed, 26 known environmental failures (identical baseline), 26 skipped.\n- ruff format/check + ty all clean.\n- `uv lock` updated (`my-claude-code v5.6.0 -> v5.7.0`).\n- Verified in a real browser on a throwaway server.\n\n## Residual risks\n\n- The 26 failures are the documented baseline, not a regression.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
