    "message": "chore: bump 5.6.0 -> 5.7.0 (MINOR: dedicated Claude Code page + theme picker fix)\n\n- The Claude Code settings config moves off the Providers page onto its own\n  \"Claude Code\" nav view, with a page heading that explains the one-click\n  Configure flow. Onboarding and the Guide route to the new page.\n- The theme picker's selected pill no longer recolors per theme accent (full\n  emerald/red fill) — it uses a neutral raised surface with an accent ring,\n  identical across all four themes.\n\nFull suite: 3706 passed, 26 known environmental failures (identical baseline),\n26 skipped. ruff format/check + ty all clean. Verified in a real browser.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
